  "functional_scope": [
    "Plain TCP durable factories for counted hostnames and immutable prepared addresses, with MQTT 5 enhanced-auth variants.",
    "Copied hostname and address-list release after admission, actual native candidate fallback, and file-backed OPEN and END on both MQTT levels.",
    "DNS refusal, timeout, cancellation and close preserve the empty store, retire the live Client and release Session and Writer claims.",
    "Real constructor quota rejection, resolver work detached from Client retirement, and separate resolver join.",
    "Enhanced auth holds OPEN until proof acceptance and preserves a prior outgoing obligation after rejection.",
    "Hostname reconnect covers warmed replacement and fresh Session restoration, with durable QoS 1 replay."
  ],
